éché", "id": "maka dia telah berbuat dosa", "ur": "پس اُس نے سرکشی کی", "bn": "অতএব সে সীমালঙ্ঘন করল", "fa": "پس گناه کرد"}}, {"arabic": "فَسَقُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "32:20", "audio": "audio/698bf490e862ce2ccad6.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "they transgressed", "bs": "griješili su", "tr": "günah işlediler", "fr": "ils ont péché", "id": "mereka telah berbuat dosa", "ur": "انہوں نے سرکشی کی", "bn": "তারা সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে", "fa": "گناه کردند"}}, {"arabic": "تَفْسُقُونَ", "count": 1, "first": "46:20", "audio": "audio/dfc9e6a3aef30099640a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) transgress", "bs": "griješite", "tr": "günah işliyorsunuz", "fr": "vous péchez", "id": "kalian berbuat dosa", "ur": "تم سرکشی کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা সীমালঙ্ঘন কর", "fa": "گناه می‌کنید"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0305.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0305.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0305.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0305.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0305.id.json"}, "sentences": []}